Ported code
-----------

`src/cljfmt_js/ns_aliases.cljs` contains ClojureScript ports of definitions
that cljfmt 0.16.5 compiles on the JVM only (they sit behind `#?(:clj …)` or
are private), taken from `cljfmt/src/cljfmt/core.cljc` at tag 0.16.5:

  find-all              root?                  root
  top?                  meta?                  skip-meta
  token?                ns-token?              ns-form?
  top-level-form        symbol-node?           leftmost-symbol
  ns-require-form?      as-keyword?            refer-keyword?
  ns-require-form-parent                       join-ns-str
  refer-zloc->refer-mapping                    refer-map-for-form
  as-zloc->alias-mapping                       alias-map-for-form
  find-namespace        stringify-map

These ports are covered by cljfmt's Eclipse Public License 1.0, not by the
MIT license of the surrounding wrapper.
